: "oculusAsset 12.png", "id": "1319764898422698", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572929_1319764901756031_7982105661700720073_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=75ZWHNjOx0AQ7kNvwFZvWvU&_nc_oc=Adrlvt-TdSWivxyiO5vsr8HJ4qQwUeCR1wk6_PeVpcccRhYV09BRGGBFxOA4YZBQZXc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB7p4ECA_x8ptb2V3w887WXGMlSOW7Z8yUy96V76uA-rQ&oe=6A490197"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Asset 5.png", "id": "895648881253348", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984445_895648884586681_4943548350184216825_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GsRm3U-SDgYQ7kNvwEraCkg&_nc_oc=AdpPdtu5dQwXZQr90w8zJ2dxRA_2huJAxxACmbCYWV9L15n1x4RwCI918PV96upyxAM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCC5ecSzgitBQi8DR63HjTVF-zWEHgUQdOJMuB_dQHRcw&oe=6A492D09"}, "display_name": "Car Parking Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Car Parking Simulator is a fully interactive, realistic and immersive car parking experience. Introducing one of the most advanced and dynamic car physics in VR.\n\nGiving players more wings of freedom by introducing a Free Roam mode in a town with a realistic traffic system, bustling with various fun activities and challenges to compete in, or just drive around and chill with any of your unlocked vehicles.\n\nFeatures:\n- All cars have realistic controls and interactive interiors with customizable right or left steering orientations.- Three main vehicle challenges, ranging from Sedan, SUV and Hatchback.\n- Formula One (F1) vehicle available as a bonus car for fun!\n- Different exhilarating environments in different parts of the day and night cycles.\n- Total 65 levels, giving you ratings based on your driving and challenge completion skills.\n- A free roam mode for players to explore using any of the unlocked vehicles or to try its own activities and challenges.", "short_description": "Car 